---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About KodaTools"
  description="Learn about KodaTools — free online calculators and everyday tools. Fast, accurate, private, and always free."
>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>About KodaTools</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Free online calculators and everyday tools for everyone.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <p>KodaTools provides fast, accurate, and free online calculators and everyday tools. From mortgage and loan calculators to BMI, calorie, percentage, and unit conversion tools, our goal is to give you reliable answers instantly — right in your browser.</p>

      <h2>Our Principles</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Fast</strong> — Results appear as you type. No buttons, no page reloads, no waiting.</li>
        <li><strong>Accurate</strong> — Every calculator uses established, verifiable formulas, shown clearly on each page.</li>
        <li><strong>Private</strong> — All calculations run entirely in your browser. We never see, store, or share your data.</li>
        <li><strong>Free</strong> — No accounts, no subscriptions, no hidden fees. Every tool is free to use, forever.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We're Supported</h2>
      <p>KodaTools is supported by unobtrusive display advertising. This allows us to keep every tool completely free while maintaining a clean, fast experience. We never let ads interfere with the tools themselves.</p>

      <h2>Accuracy &amp; Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>We work hard to ensure every calculator is accurate and up to date. However, all tools are provided for informational purposes only. Financial and health calculators are estimates and are not a substitute for professional financial, medical, or legal advice. Always consult a qualified professional for decisions that matter.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Have a suggestion for a new tool, or found something that could be improved? We'd love to hear from you. Visit our <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--primary);">contact page</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
